{
  "_help": "Each service is one game port to protect. Only the featured games are enabled; set \"enabled\": true on the ones you run and false on the rest. Set every 'origin' to your HIDDEN backend IP:port. Each enabled 'listen' port must be unique — many games share defaults (7777, 27015), so change the port if you run two of them. Ports are the games' defaults; match them to your server's own config.",
